      "index": 2,
      "path": "docs/platform/agent-mailbox/spec.md",
      "line": 692,
      "before": "| 2026-10-20 | Independent architecture panel: five claims of the draft did not stand (an unlocked rename called a transaction; `delivered` called \"in context\"; a cycle proof by pair counts; a shell guard as a cost model; unauthenticated identity granting human exemptions). Applied here: snapshot record under a mutex, `offered`, attempt token plus generation, emit-then-conditional-finish, depth proof struck, lifetime cap, native hook selector, empty-composer predicate in agent-protocol (since moved to section 15.8), body escaping, refusal counters bounded, interactive-session scope. The workflow ended `failed` before its final report was closed, so this is a read of its summary, not a finished verdict | panel, applied by the controller | applied; two forks left open (section 16: the Stop-drain decision and the record layout; Stop-drain permits only wake-enabled mail to start an idle turn); `plans/reports/research-261020-1327-mailbox-spec-architecture-panel.md` |",
      "after": "| 2026-10-20 | Independent architecture panel: five claims of the draft did not stand (an unlocked rename called a transaction; `delivered` called \"in context\"; a cycle proof by pair counts; a shell guard as a cost model; unauthenticated identity granting human exemptions). Applied here: snapshot record under a mutex, `offered`, attempt token plus generation, emit-then-conditional-finish, depth proof struck, lifetime cap, native hook selector, empty-composer predicate in agent-protocol (since moved to section 15.8), body escaping, refusal counters bounded, interactive-session scope. The workflow ended `failed` before its final report was closed, so this is a read of its summary, not a finished verdict | panel, applied by the controller | applied; two forks recorded at the time (section 16): the Stop-drain decision, later settled so that only wake-enabled mail starts an idle turn, and the record layout; `plans/reports/research-261020-1327-mailbox-spec-architecture-panel.md` |"
    }
  ],
